    <Label Name="Label5" Style="13" DecimalsToShow="2" Text="By moving the point E find such its position,\nfor which AE + BE + CD + DE is minimal.\nPay attention to:\n - convex quadrilateral\n - nonconvex quadrilateral." X="0.844550754999737" Y="5.3836410058039" />
